---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Newsletter from '../../components/Newsletter.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Feedback and support — Collectively Bzy" description="Feedback and support information for Collectively Bzy projects.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Feedback + support</div><h1>Tell us where it catches.</h1><p>Found a rough edge, have a thoughtful suggestion, or need a hand with one of our projects? This is the support path.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="split-callout"><div class="split-callout-art" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="split-callout-copy"><div class="eyebrow">A clear path</div><h2>Need a hand?</h2><p>Email the support desk with the app name, what happened, and the device or browser you were using. That gives us the useful details without asking you to create another account.</p><a class="button" href="mailto:support@collectivelybzy.com?subject=Collectively%20Bzy%20support">Email support</a></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section sand"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Feedback</div><h2>Bring the useful details.</h2></div><p>For general notes, ideas, or partnership questions, use <a href="mailto:hello@collectivelybzy.com">hello@collectivelybzy.com</a>. App support stays separate so important issues are easier to find.</p></div><div class="grid three"><article class="card"><div><div class="eyebrow">Apps</div><h3 class="card-title">Something not working?</h3><p class="card-copy">Choose the app, note what happened, and include the device or browser details that help us reproduce it.</p></div></article><article class="card"><div><div class="eyebrow">Store</div><h3 class="card-title">Have a product note?</h3><p class="card-copy">Send store questions, special-related comments, or a tip about something that needs clarifying.</p></div></article><article class="card"><div><div class="eyebrow">Privacy</div><h3 class="card-title">Keep it lightweight.</h3><p class="card-copy">Share the details that help us understand the issue. Please leave passwords, payment details, and other sensitive information out of support emails.</p></div></article></div></div></section>
  <Newsletter />
</BaseLayout>
